{"sha": "edba616ef2033e46f33e162a8100a0159502a7d2706ccad84b44e3ec65f71008", "body": ["\\begin{remark}[本卷的其他视角]", "由此展望的联系。面积元 $\\sqrt{EG -", "F^2}\\,\\dd u\\,\\dd v$ 其实是伪装的二维雅可比", "而 \\cref{ch:b2:multint} 使这一类比", "与换元定理严格对应 --- 那里的曲面", "积分即本章的面积，附带一个被积函数", "。第一基本形式是正定", "二次型的场，逐点借助", "\\cref{ch:b2:quadratic} 中的工具处理，其谱定理也支撑", "本章周末问题中的二次曲面分类。而法线", "驱动约束集上的极值问题", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:surfaces:closest}），是", "拉格朗日乘子法的几何雏形，由", "\\cref{thm:b2:diffcalc:extrema} 勾勒。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) ellipse (1.5 and 0.95);", "  \\draw[omThm] (0,0) ellipse (1.5 and 0.35);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.25) {椭球面};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] plot[domain=-1.1:1.1, samples=30]", "    ({0.6*(exp(\\x)+exp(-\\x))/2}, {\\x});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] plot[domain=-1.1:1.1, samples=30]", "    ({-0.6*(exp(\\x)+exp(-\\x))/2}, {\\x});", "  \\draw[omThm] (0,0) ellipse (0.6 and 0.16);", "  \\draw[omDef] (0,1.1) ellipse (1.0 and 0.22);", "  \\draw[omDef] (0,-1.1) ellipse (1.0 and 0.22);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.55)", "    {单叶双曲面};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] plot[domain=-1.05:1.05, samples=30]", "    ({\\x}, {1.1*\\x*\\x - 1.1});", "  \\draw[omThm] (0,0.055) ellipse (1.0 and 0.22);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.45)", "    {椭圆抛物面};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] plot[domain=-1:1, samples=30]", "    ({\\x}, {0.55*\\x*\\x});", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] plot[domain=-1:1, samples=30]", "    ({0.45*\\x}, {-0.55*\\x*\\x + 0.18*\\x});", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.15)", "    {双曲抛物面};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 下图为周末问题中分类的九种二次曲面中的四种，", "以其轮廓线及一条等高线示意", "（红色）：有界椭球面、带腰的双直纹单叶双曲面、", "椭圆抛物面的碗状面，以及", "马鞍面，其两条抛物截线", "朝相反方向弯曲。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[应用]", "面积元 $\\norm{\\sigma_u\\wedge\\sigma_v}\\,\\dd u\\,\\dd v$", "是 \\cref{ch:b2:multint} 中的曲面积分测度，它在此与", "格林公式相遇；第一基本形式是", "二次型场的原型，逐点研究，", "借助 \\cref{ch:b2:quadratic} 中的工具；本章的", "周末问题利用谱定理对所有二次曲面", "分类。本科三年级分册借助", "微分形式与散度定理重新讨论曲面，以及内蕴", "曲率——即 $E, F, G$ 所反映的弯曲性质——", "是通向微分几何本身的门户。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:surfaces:1}", "证明：锥面 $z = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$ 的所有切平面", "（去掉顶点）都经过顶点。\\emph{（取参数表示", "$\\sigma(\\theta, r) = (r\\cos\\theta, r\\sin\\theta, r)$, $r > 0$.)}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:surfaces:2}", "求椭球面 $\\frac{x^2}{a^2} +", "\\frac{y^2}{b^2} + \\frac{z^2}{c^2} = 1$ 上一点 $(x_0, y_0,", "z_0)$ 处的切平面。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:surfaces:3}", "计算 $E, F, G$，其中螺旋面 $\\sigma(u, v) = (v\\cos u,\\", "v\\sin u,\\ au)$, $a > 0$，以及该片 $0 \\leq u \\leq", "2\\pi$, $0 \\leq v \\leq 1$ 的面积，写成积分形式（利用", "$\\int\\sqrt{v^2 + a^2}\\,\\dd v = \\frac12\\bigl(v\\sqrt{v^2+a^2} +", "a^2\\ln(v + \\sqrt{v^2 + a^2})\\bigr) + C$).", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:surfaces:4}", "（环面）写出环面的参数化，该环面由圆心为", "$(R, 0, 0)$、半径为 $r < R$ 的圆在 $xz$ 平面内绕", "$z$ 轴旋转得到：", "\\[", "\\sigma(\\theta, \\psi) = \\bigl((R + r\\cos\\psi)\\cos\\theta,\\", "(R + r\\cos\\psi)\\sin\\theta,\\ r\\sin\\psi\\bigr).", "\\]", "计算 $E, F, G$，检验正则性，并证明面积为", "$4\\pi^2 R r$（帕普斯：平均周长 $2\\pi R$ 乘以圆的", "周长 $2\\pi r$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:surfaces:5}", "证明 $f \\in \\mathcal{C}^1(K)$ 的图像面积为", "$\\iint_K \\sqrt{1 + f_x^2 + f_y^2}\\,\\dd x\\,\\dd y$，并计算它", "对抛物面片 $z = \\frac12(x^2 + y^2)$ 在圆盘", "$x^2 + y^2 \\leq 1$ 上的部分（用极坐标，", "见\\cref{ch:b2:multint}）。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}